        "title": "Prosecutors will not appeal sentencing of DV murderer Daniel Billings",
        "content": {
          "descriptor": {
            "type": "tagname",
            "key": "div",
            "props": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "@@standfirst",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "The Office of the Director of Public Prosecutions will not appeal the 28-year sentence handed down to murderer Daniel Billings. The 31-year-old stabbed his former partner Molly Ticehurst to death in 2024."
